  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Society Empowerment for Human Rights and Democracy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective: Contribute to strengthening and promoting Civil Society Organisations (CSO) and Community-Based Organisations (CBOs) engagement of women and youth as actors of good governance and democratic rights in Liberia&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific objectives (SO): SO1: Improved capacity and participation of CSOs and CBOs in promoting political and social rights, especially for women and youth. SO2: Enhanced civic engagement between CBOs, CSOs and local government, with a focus on women and youth. SO3: Strengthened engagement between the Independent National Commission on Human Rights (INHCR) and CSOs on Human Rights and Democracy (HR&amp;D).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
